## The ZeroAI execution loop

```text
USER / EVENT
      ↓
INTENT CONTRACT
      ↓
CONTROL PLANE
      ↓
TASK GRAPH
      ↓
AGENT / TOOL EXECUTION
      ↓
OBSERVATION + EVIDENCE
      ↓
VERIFICATION
      ↓
MEMORY REDUCTION
      ↓
CERTIFICATION / REJECTION
      ↓
NEXT STATE
```

Every run should produce a **state transition**, not merely another conversation message.

