## ZeroMemory

This is the part that makes ZeroAI materially different.

Do **not** keep shoving entire chat histories back into the model.

Use:

```text
Raw Events
   ↓
Memory Extractor
   ↓
Fact Graph
   ↓
Dedupe
   ↓
Conflict Resolution
   ↓
Salience Scoring
   ↓
Compaction
   ↓
Active Memory
```

### Active-memory target

I would still use roughly:

```text
Identity / standing rules       64 KB
Projects / goals               128 KB
Durable facts                  256 KB
Recent compressed context      192 KB
Learned patterns               128 KB
Open issues / contradictions   128 KB
Versioning / reserve           ~100 KB
```

**Typical operating target: 128–256 KB.**

**Hard ceiling: ~1 MB.**

Cold history can be effectively unlimited.

The AI sees the **smallest sufficient state**.

