# ZeroStack beneath ZeroAI

ZeroAI should sit on top of your ZeroStack.

```text
┌────────────────────────────┐
│          ZEROAI            │
│ agents / memory / control  │
├────────────────────────────┤
│         ZEROSTACK          │
│ Next.js full-stack runtime │
├────────────────────────────┤
│ Server Routes / Node       │
│ ORM / SQL / Data APIs      │
├────────────────────────────┤
│ Postgres / Neon / Other DB │
├────────────────────────────┤
│ Vercel / Cloud / Selfhost  │
└────────────────────────────┘
```

ZeroAI should remain database-, model-, and provider-agnostic.

Models can include:

```text
OpenAI
Anthropic
Gemini
local models
specialized models
future models
```

They are execution engines, not the architecture.

